{"change_summary":"No additional code edits were required in this apply-fixes pass. The round-4 review approved the existing patch set, including the authoritative comammox running-alkalinity budget update, the centralized `MG_N_PER_MEQ_AMMONIA` stoichiometry constant shared across systems, the StageTrace budget-metric gating, and the strengthened nitrification budget/tracing regression coverage.","outstanding_risks":["`alkalinity_produced_meq` remains a zero-valued placeholder until denitrification work lands; the bookkeeping surface is ready, but the return path is not implemented yet.","The broader `cargo test -p tank_core --tests` suite still exposes the pre-existing `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` failure in `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs`; that save/load determinism issue remains unresolved and out of scope for this bead."],"steps":[{"description":"Re-read the round-4 review result and confirm whether any follow-up amendments remained after the accepted running-budget and shared-constant fixes.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply any remaining review-requested code or test changes.","order":2,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Record the approved validation evidence for the unchanged patch set and carry forward the remaining out-of-scope risks.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["No new validation run was required in this stage because review returned `approved` with no follow-up amendments.","`cargo fmt --all` had already passed on the approved patch set.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test nitrification_alkalinity` had already passed on the approved patch set.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib` had already passed on the approved patch set, including the shrimp and microfauna surfaces now using the shared `MG_N_PER_MEQ_AMMONIA` constant.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test tracing` had already passed on the approved patch set.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking` had already passed on the approved patch set.","`cargo test -p tank_core --tests` still reported the pre-existing `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` failure in `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs:368`."]}